# Frontend

- Functional components only. Colocate a feature under `src/components/<Feature>/`.
- Server state and auth session go through Zustand stores (`userStore`, `emailStore`). Do not introduce another state library.
- All HTTP calls go through `services/apiClient.ts`. Send the session token from `useUserStore`; do not call `fetch` against the API from components.
- Shared response types live in `src/types`. Add a field there when the API shape changes, then use it in `apiClient`.
- Style with Tailwind utility classes already used in the screen. Keep the Gmail-style shell: sidebar plus main pane, dark/light via the existing theme hook.
- Gate signed-in UI on the persisted session in `userStore`. Auth screens stay in `components/Auth`.

```tsx
// Component calls the client, not fetch.
const emails = await listEmails();
```
